  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet syftar till att st&#xe4;rka den tekniska kompetensen p&#xe5; Ruhuna Universitetet f&#xf6;r att kunna bilda en marin vetenskapsfakultet. St&#xf6;d till forskning inom marin vetenskap skall ocks&#xe5; ing&#xe5;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support aims at strengthening the manpower and technical capabilities of Ruhuna university with a view to upgrade its status to a Faculty of Fisheries and Marine Sciences, to conduct undergraduate and graduate courses and to carry out research on Marine Sciences ensuring sustainable utilisation of coastal and marine resources.</narrative>
  </description>
